# Java layers

Keep work in the existing packages under `com.examprep`:

| Layer | Package |
|-------|---------|
| Model / enums | `model` |
| Persistence | `dao` |
| Rules | `service` |
| HTTP / routing | `servlet` (admin, user, auth, api) |
| Cross-cutting | `filter` |
| Startup / config | `config` |

- Servlets stay thin: validate, call a service, set request attributes, forward to JSP or redirect.
- Do not put SQL in servlets or JSP. Do not put HTML in services.
- New filters only when auth, CSRF, or entitlement paths change.
- Match existing naming: `*Servlet`, `*Service`, `*Dao`.
- Java 17 language level. No new frameworks.
